y":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible: 4.6.2.stable, 4.7.beta (c3284cd69)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.2.stable - Linux Mint 22.3 (Zena) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 (nvidia; 570.211.01) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-4790K CPU @ 4.00GHz (8 threads) - 15.48 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen I paste longer text into scene tree filter I get no results. When I shorten the text after pasting it I get some results. When I extend it again, I get even more results. I would expect to see the same set of results in all cases.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eac30b9a-96bb-4d56-be58-7e7c22954bc6\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nPaste text into scene tree filter using ctrl+v. Scene tree must be quite complex, everything works fine for simple scenes.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n~~I don't have any. I tried to it on a simple scene and could not reproduce it.~~\nEdit: I managed to simplify the scene and create a MRP.\n\n[filter_issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28004687/filter_issue.zip)\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/priva